OL,3,GNEWSANew #6.5 million respite centre to
OL,4,Asupport families
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new #6.5 million respite care centre
OL,7,Fwill help families of people with
OL,8,Fadditional needs to rest and recharge
OL,9,Fwhile their loved ones are looked
OL,10,Fafter, a council says.
OL,12,FSurrey County Council has opened the
OL,13,Frespite centre, called The Squirrels,
OL,14,Fin Banstead after previously opening a
OL,15,Fsimilar centre in Woking in 2025.
OL,17,FThe new eight-room centre will allow
OL,18,Fthe council to offer respite care to
OL,19,F140 more families each year, a
OL,20,Fspokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
