OL,3,GNEWSANew #6.5 million respite centre to
OL,4,Asupport families
OL,5,
OL,6,FMother Eleri, whose son David uses the
OL,7,Fservices, said: "It's really important
OL,8,Fto me and the rest of the family that
OL,9,Fhe's happy here as it means we can take
OL,10,Fan occasional break ourselves."
